{# Roll the branch verdicts back up into an answer to the key question (Pyramid Principle). #}
{{ config(output_format="json") }}
{% set names = ref('issue_tree.branches[*].name') %}
{% set tree = ref('issue_tree') %}
You are the engagement partner. Synthesise the team's work into an answer.

Business idea: {{ ref('business_idea') }}
Key question: {{ ref('situation').key_question }}
Success criteria: {{ ref('situation').success_criteria }}
Original governing hypothesis: {{ tree.governing_hypothesis }}

Branch results:
{% for t in ref('branch') %}{% set name = names[loop.index0] %}
- {{ name }}: {{ t.verdict }} ({{ t.confidence }} confidence)
  revised: {{ t.revised_hypothesis }}
{% endfor %}

Follow the Pyramid Principle: lead with the answer, then the three supporting
arguments. Say plainly if the governing hypothesis survived, changed, or died.

Return only JSON:
{
  "answer": "one-sentence answer to the key question",
  "recommendation": "go" | "no-go" | "go with conditions",
  "governing_hypothesis_status": "confirmed" | "revised" | "rejected",
  "revised_governing_hypothesis": "...",
  "supporting_arguments": ["...", "...", "..."],
  "biggest_risk": "...",
  "next_steps": ["the 3 cheapest experiments that would most reduce uncertainty"]
}
